    <unit id="AlwaysOn">
      <segment>
        <source>Always-on VPN</source>
        <target state="translated">始终开启的 VPN</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="AlwaysOnHint">
      <segment>
        <source>To keep apps blocked even if NetworkControl stops, turn on "Always-on VPN" and "Block connections without VPN" for NetworkControl in system settings.</source>
        <target state="translated">若要在 NetworkControl 停止时仍阻断应用，请在系统设置中为 NetworkControl 开启“始终开启的 VPN”和“屏蔽未使用 VPN 的连接”。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="Battery">
      <segment>
        <source>Battery optimization</source>
        <target state="translated">电池优化</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BatteryHint">
      <segment>
        <source>Some phones stop background apps aggressively. Exclude NetworkControl from battery optimization if protection turns off by itself.</source>
        <target state="translated">部分手机会积极停止后台应用。如果保护会自行关闭，请将 NetworkControl 排除在电池优化之外。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
